          "level": 2,
          "content": "Figure it Out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.201,
            0.834,
            0.221
          ],
          "content": "1. Fold a rectangular sheet of paper, then draw a line along the fold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.224,
            0.618,
            0.358
          ],
          "content": "created. Name and compare the angles formed between the fold and the sides of the paper. Make different angles by folding a rectangular sheet of paper and compare the angles. Which is the largest and smallest angle you made?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.626,
            0.238,
            0.835,
            0.343
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
