        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.36,
            0.615,
            0.403
          ],
          "content": "2. In each case, determine which angle is greater and why."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.197,
            0.412,
            0.384,
            0.431
          ],
          "content": "a. $\\angle \\mathrm{AOB}  or  \\angle \\mathrm{XOY}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.197,
            0.44,
            0.385,
            0.459
          ],
          "content": "b. $\\angle \\mathrm{AOB}  or  \\angle \\mathrm{XOB}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.198,
            0.469,
            0.389,
            0.488
          ],
          "content": "c. $\\angle \\mathrm{XOB}  or  \\angle \\mathrm{XOC}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.196,
            0.492,
            0.546,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": "Discuss with your friends on how you decided which one is greater."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.57,
            0.403,
